#: ../../source/docs/learning-ardupilot-threading.rst:5
#: 70f7224b7ec44e9cafc385de7e8fda62
msgid "Threading"
msgstr "线程"

#: ../../source/docs/learning-ardupilot-threading.rst:8
#: 53a3e96d5af2429a83ca849423046e34
msgid "Understanding ArduPilot threading"
msgstr "理解 ArduPilot 线程"

#: ../../source/docs/learning-ardupilot-threading.rst:10
#: 63d3fc51d50745f2bbbaeb6db259fce5
msgid ""
"Once you have learned the basic of the ArduPilot libraries it is time for "
"you to understand how ArduPilot deals with threading. The setup()/loop() "
"structure that was inherited from arduino may make it seem that ArduPilot is"
" a single threaded system, but in fact it isn't."
msgstr ""
"一旦您了解了 ArduPilot 库的基础知识，就该理解 ArduPilot 如何处理线程了。从 Arduino 继承的 setup()/loop() "
"结构可能让人感觉 ArduPilot 是单线程系统，但实际上并非如此。"

#: ../../source/docs/learning-ardupilot-threading.rst:15
#: 3ec8468b664f45df8354242ad020fafd
msgid ""
"The threading approach in ArduPilot depends on the board it is built for. "
"Some boards (such as the APM1 and APM2) don't support threads, so make do "
"with a simple timer and callbacks. Some boards (PX4 and Linux) support a "
"rich Posix threading model with realtime priorities, and these are used "
"extensively by ArduPilot."
msgstr ""
"ArduPilot 中的线程方式取决于目标主板。某些主板（如 APM1 和 APM2）不支持线程，因此使用简单的定时器和回调代替。某些主板（PX4 和 "
"Linux）支持具有实时优先级的丰富 Posix 线程模型，ArduPilot 广泛使用这些功能。"

#: ../../source/docs/learning-ardupilot-threading.rst:21
#: 2cf4adc47399496885ec10748cb80f54
msgid ""
"There are a number of key concepts related to threading that you need to "
"understand in ArduPilot:"
msgstr "在 ArduPilot 中，您需要理解以下几个与线程相关的关键概念："

